      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STORM COMING (1) missed the frame latest when eighth at Ballarat (26.39) but was a winner three back in the second best time of the program. Better than last start and worth following up. MIGHTY MIKADO (2) is a well performed sprinter ideally suited at the shorter trips. Scored over 350m at this track last time in a Mix 6/7 (19.31). Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Can measure up again. AUSSIE SUPREME (8) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 20.01 beating LET'S PLAY BALL. Expected to feature again. PAW OLIVE (3) is worth including after a top-three finish most recently.",
